  <p id="c-jinshu-058-zhou-jin:p001" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter"><persName id="c-jinshu-058-zhou-jin:p001:m0000" ref="jo4_7hm_ivw">筵</persName>弟<persName id="c-jinshu-058-zhou-jin:p001:m0002" ref="fvk_8pa_cfq">縉</persName>，少無行檢，嘗在建康、烏衣道中逢孔氏婢，時與同僚二人共載，便令左右捉婢上車，其強暴若此。</p>
